{"answer_text":"Accurate forecasts come from clean stage data plus weighted or AI-assisted models. Tools known for forecasting: [1]\n\n- **Northwind CRM Revenue Cloud**: Excellent forecasting and territory tools, but setup usually needs a dedicated admin. [2]\n- **Pipewell Flow**: The forecasting specialist: scenario planning and deal-risk scoring out of the box. [3]\n- **Halcyon Sales Pro**: Combines cadences, dialer and pipeline in one place. [4]\n\nIn short, Northwind CRM is the safest default here; Pipewell is worth a look if forecasting matters most.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50d0-74e1-a030-587c47ca7817","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0051,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:08.250Z","engine":"perplexity","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["weighted pipeline forecast tool","crm revenue forecasting accuracy","sales forecasting software comparison"],"latency_ms":5350,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a0332cede9","market_name":"United States","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[121,134],[444,457]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889b1141e640","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Pipewell","name_text":"Pipewell","offsets":[[246,254],[486,494]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889c3d4225fd","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Halcyon Sales","name_text":"Halcyon Sales","offsets":[[355,368]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive